<codeline><highlight class="normal">#<sp/>Scatter<sp/>Architecture:<sp/>ScatterField,<sp/>Forest,<sp/>and<sp/>RockField</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">This<sp/>document<sp/>details<sp/>the<sp/>uniform<sp/>scattering<sp/>architecture<sp/>in<sp/>HighMap,<sp/>describing<sp/>the<sp/>relationship<sp/>between<sp/>the<sp/>base<sp/>`ScatterField`<sp/>container<sp/>and<sp/>its<sp/>domain-specific<sp/>specializations:<sp/>`Forest`<sp/>and<sp/>`RockField`.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">##<sp/>1.<sp/>Class<sp/>and<sp/>Dependency<sp/>Diagram</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">The<sp/>architecture<sp/>decouples<sp/>lightweight<sp/>instance<sp/>storage<sp/>from<sp/>domain<sp/>descriptors<sp/>and<sp/>simulation<sp/>algorithms.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
